@display("std/js")
js: component(path = "std/js", lang = "heron") {
  | Foreign functions and [extension points](#language.interop.declaring.extension_point) implemented in JS or TS, and the generator that writes their TS types.
  |
  | Its surface is declared in `std/js/package.heron`, whose types the API
  | reference renders; each export is specified where its behaviour is:
  |
  | | Export         | Specified in                                                         |
  | | -------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |
  | | `module`, `js` | [Declaring foreign code](#language.interop.declaring)                |
  | | `ts`           | [Generated bindings](#language.interop.packaging.generated_bindings) |

  uses = [language.std.types]
}
